<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers steady, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 63.00-67.00; 700-800 lbs 60.00-64.50; 800-900 lbs few 66.75. Holstein Large 2 600-700 lbs 49.00-58.00.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 58.50-62.50. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 900</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
